    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Farm Management</strong><br>Plant fruits, vegetables, cereals, and raise various animals (cows, chickens, goats, pigs, alpacas...) to produce goods like milk, eggs, and wool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc14 <strong>Breeding &amp; Genetics</strong><br>Breed your animals to pass down powerful genes, improve their stats, and try to obtain rare golden animals with special powers and visuals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Turn-based Animal Battles</strong><br>Form a team of 4 animals, customize their stats, and engage in strategic PvP battles! Train your team daily and climb the rankings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Expand and Personalize</strong><br>Unlock vehicles, expand your land, build barns and greenhouses, and boost your production efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Seasons and Weather</strong><br>The seasons and weather influence your farm and your animals\u2019 strength in battle \u2014 plan ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Events, Rankings, and Community</strong><br>Join weekly and monthly competitions, complete seasonal events, and climb the leaderboards as the best farmer or the strongest battler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Relaxing but Competitive</strong><br>Play at your own pace: focus on farming, breeding, or PvP battles \u2014 your farm evolves even when you\u2019re offline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc23 Why try Farmer Toon?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Free, with no pay-to-win</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Rich yet accessible gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Ideal for fans of strategy, simulation or collecting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Developed with passion by a solo creator \ud83d\udc9b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf81 Welcome bonus: A bonus of 50% plant growth speed for 2 hours offered to new players to get you started faster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
